 SQLDelete section.
 sd001.

*>
*> Base table DELETE removes RGs...referential integrity
*>
*> Deletion is supported using any defined key of reference...
*>
     evaluate MOST-which-key             *> vbc - MUST ALWAYS delete in NON dup keys so only 1 or 2
        WHEN 1    *> ALSO 3   ?????????  *> Force primary on dup allowed key
           EXEC SQL
              DELETE from [STOCK-REC]
                     WHERE [Stock-Key] = :HV-DynamicParm
           END-EXEC
*>        WHEN 2
